---
const today = new Date();
---

<footer>
	<div class="inner">
		<span class="brand"><span class="logo">⚽</span> 스포츠킹덤24</span>
		<nav class="links">
			<a href="/">홈</a>
			<a href="/blog">전체 글</a>
			<a href="/about">소개</a>
			<a href="/author">운영자 소개</a>
			<a href="/privacy">개인정보처리방침</a>
			<a href="/contact">문의하기</a>
			<a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a>
		</nav>
		<span class="copy">&copy; {today.getFullYear()} 스포츠킹덤24</span>
	</div>
	<div class="meta">
		<p class="desc">
			축구의 규칙·포지션·전술·리그·선수·중계 보는 법을 초보자 눈높이로 정리하는 축구 전문 블로그입니다.
		</p>
		<p class="who">
			운영자 <strong>Sungbin</strong> · 문의
			<a href="mailto:yangsungbin77@gmail.com">yangsungbin77@gmail.com</a>
		</p>
	</div>
</footer>
<style>
	footer {
		border-top: 2px solid var(--ink);
		margin-top: 4rem;
		background: transparent;
	}
	.inner {
		width: var(--maxw);
		max-width: calc(100% - 2.5em);
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 2rem 0 3rem;
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 1rem;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
	}
	.brand {
		font-family: var(--font-heading);
		font-weight: 800;
		color: var(--ink);
	}
	.logo {}
	.links { display: flex; gap: 1.2rem; }
	.links a {
		color: var(--text-muted);
		font-weight: 600;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}
	.links a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
	.copy { color: var(--text-dim); font-size: 0.85rem; }
	.meta {
		width: var(--maxw);
		max-width: calc(100% - 2.5em);
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 0 0 2.5rem;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--border, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1));
		padding-top: 1.2rem;
		margin-top: -1rem;
	}
	.meta p {
		margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
		color: var(--text-dim);
		font-size: 0.85rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}
	.meta .who strong { color: var(--text-muted); }
	.meta a { color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 600; }
	.meta a:hover { color: var(--accent); }
</style>
